    "created_at": "2024-11-04T07:50:29Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-11-04T07:52:08Z",
    "body": "Perhaps we could add something like `[Exposed=Extensions]` to IDL and have a corresponding check available on environment settings objects (when we cannot rely on IDL alone)?\r\n\r\nThat still leaves the question of what exact API shape we want here, but would at least address the exposure question and present a path for other APIs of similar nature.\r\n\r\n(It would definitely increase the scope of what specifications have covered to date, but it's probably reasonable given the focus on interoperable extensions code.)",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
