    "updated_at": "2024-11-05T22:38:33Z",
    "body": "It might be good to check in with folks writing accessibility auditing tools who have been asking for this type of API for years, too. `querySelector[All]` might be sufficient, but it might be nice to have an option for `TreeWalker` as well?",
